// HTTP request file for Clarus Mens API
// =====================================

// This file is used to test the API using the HTTP client.

// Environment URLs - uncomment one to select environment
@local = http://localhost:5209
@docker = http://localhost:5000
@azure = https://clarus-mens-app.azurewebsites.net

// ACTIVE ENVIRONMENT: Set this to the environment you want to test against
//@ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress = {{local}}
@ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress = {{docker}}
//@ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress = {{azure}}

// To test different environments:
// 1. For local development: Use @ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress = {{local}}
// 2. For Docker container: Use @ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress = {{docker}}
//    Then run: docker run -p 5000:80 clarusmenscr.azurecr.io/clarus-mens:[version]
// 3. For Azure deployment: Use @ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress = {{azure}}

### Root Endpoint
# Access the API root endpoint which provides essential information
GET {{ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Health Check Endpoint
# Check the API health status
GET {{ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI JSON Definition
# Access the API specification
GET {{ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI UI (Swagger)
# Access the interactive API documentation
GET {{ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress}}/swagger
Accept: text/html

### Version information
# Get the version information
GET {{ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress}}/api/version
Accept: application/json

### Diagnostics
# Get runtime diagnostic information
GET {{ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress}}/api/diagnostics
Accept: application/json

### Question
# Get the answer
GET {{ClarusMensAPI_HostAddress}}/api/question?query=hello
Accept: application/json
